{"server":"cn","storyId":"act46side_level_act46side_09_end","groupId":"act46side","stageId":"act46side_09","title":"凛刃出匣","storyCode":"OS-9","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act46side/level_act46side_09_end.txt","sourceHash":"7dbba791026a6624d7666f6b965305a9e591ea9a356160810d444534425c9419","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"面对开斯特的军事施压，谢拉格众人没有轻易妥协。锏为保护菈塔托丝被“灰礼帽”围攻，阿克托斯带领士兵在边境与敌军对峙，恩希欧迪斯在军工厂展开最后的筹备。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已到达预定位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"公爵的最新指示是，菈塔托丝的诈死必有隐情，她身上很可能带有重要情报，要留活口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是前院，院内空虚，准备直接突破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要引起注意，力求速战速决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯有一点要当心，黑骑士很有可能还在此处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可是，黑骑士人呢？"},{"type":"narration","text":"入侵者警觉四顾，握紧手中武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"z\n一支黑色的锏以不可思议的速度飞袭而来，入侵者被巨大的力道击飞，重重撞在墙上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g5_guestroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2006_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2006_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听到外面......又有打斗的声音——到底发生了什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小点声！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在外面都是最危险的敌人，那位锏在拼了命地保护我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在唯一能做的事，就是安静点，别让他们发现我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2006_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我听到广播里说，我是被谢拉格挟持的人质？为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......你的维多利亚同胞现在正带着武器，开着战车，将这里围得水泄不通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，是想要救你出去，还是要把知情者围困在这里以便展开其他行动，答案显而易见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2006_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是，他们用救我的借口，入侵谢拉格......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你自己说的......不过现实差不多就是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2006_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2006_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么会变成这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你的资料能传出去，你也可以向你的国家问问这个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2006_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为我来到谢拉格，可以为受压迫的人们带来帮助......我的镜头与文章，可以让更多人看到真实的谢拉格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2006_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本相信我做的这一切都是有意义的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是不是还该感谢你的好心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我就当你是真的好心吧——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别犯傻了，你凭什么觉得，你看到的就是“真实的谢拉格”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现状你也看到了，在压迫谢拉格人民的到底是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2006_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"屋檐上的融雪化为庭院中的积水，入侵者的血溅落出道道涟漪。\n他的前方，逆光而来的暗沉面孔正直视着他。\n不远处，堂厅内的烛火像是挣扎未释的杀气，激荡、翻涌......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的战力，怪不得那位在对谢拉格的报告中特意强调了黑骑士的存在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早知道你们会偷摸闯进来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......哼，反正我也分不清你们这些面具下面到底谁是谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们那个来过谢拉格的同事，难道没有告诉过你们，谢拉格不是能随便侵犯的土地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我们的确听说过你的大名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我们也做好了充分的准备......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来是想靠数量取胜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有人打算和你争胜，只是任务而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能穿上这身衣服的，算是精英。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不打疼一点，是不知道的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想过去，先变成尸体。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一起上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也难得放开手脚，没什么顾虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就当你们没人是装作不怕死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她摆开致命的架势，空气中划出武器呜咽的闷音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"众人抽出利刃，寒光流闪，步步逼近，踏过倒映着污浊天空的积水。\n这片千年圣地，即将迎来毫无保留的厮杀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"湿润的空气愈发热烈干燥，雪落即融，雾气蒸腾，积水四溅。\n仿佛金属与血肉也能碰撞出鲜红的火花。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错，再来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g5_guestroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2006_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我从没想过，会是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2006_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菈塔托丝夫人，我是不是不该来谢拉格？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个问题需要你自己回答，也需要你的国家回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是对于谢拉格来说，或许我也会考虑利用你这样单纯的人......我也没有资格骂那些维多利亚人卑鄙就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2006_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那么我的报道，对维多利亚，对谢拉格，到底算是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在你身上做文章，不过是想要创造既定事实，你不用太认真。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都是人质而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2006_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是觉得这一切都很荒谬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这倒也是真相的一种......如果你的镜头还好用的话，这会是绝佳的素材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2006_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果......我走出这道门，你们就会没事的，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么你会被他们用刀剑指着，你的所有资料会被没收，或许连你本人也会从此销声匿迹，没有人知道你的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了这个地步......更了解他们的应该是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔贝塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_2006_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道就在这里，什么都不去做吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对维多利亚来说，我想他们不希望失去你这个人质。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安心等待，以及......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希欧迪斯......无论你打算做什么，是时候开始了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩尔罗契士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报告！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩尔罗契士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯大人，我们已经按照您的指挥，搭建了临时防御工事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩尔罗契士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人的舰队没有开火，在距离我们三公里的地方继续行军，我们该如何应对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炸药储备呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩尔罗契士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_284_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能搬的全都搬过来了，我们拼上这条命，起码能拖延一会维多利亚人的推进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你去指挥列阵，我先亲自会一会这帮维多利亚佬！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"军舰在他面前停下，深灰色的装甲板反射着阳光，这是阿克托斯平生鲜有的需要仰望的时刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁是指挥官？让他出来说话！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1337_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯·佩尔罗契，我的长官不希望和你发生冲突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那要取决于你们来谢拉格的目的，别告诉我你们一群人在山林里迷路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1337_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵阁下发布的公开信已经讲清楚了一切，我们需要捍卫维多利亚的利益，同时也会帮助谢拉格稳定天灾后的局势。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1337_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们所求的，则是让扰乱谢拉格的罪魁祸首恩希欧迪斯受到应有的审判，相信这与佩尔罗契家的想法并不矛盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在的想法只有一个，你们再往前一步，我就让你们付出这往前一步的代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你们踏过我的尸体之前，休想踏入谢拉格的土地！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_G14_miningarea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚守卫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回来了？指挥官又有什么指示？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚守卫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"还是那套，让我们专心守好最后这岗，等他们的人完全进来，一定能找到谢拉格的军火库。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚守卫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查了那么久，还是没一点头绪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚守卫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"可不是。哪怕真像他们说的，谢拉格没法弄出什么大动静来，我也不信那个恩希欧迪斯会没有一点防备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚守卫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许——嗯？又来了辆物流车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚守卫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"得了，这回说什么都得你去管，上次翻那些豆子可把我累惨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚守卫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他冲着缓缓驶来的车辆摆手，而对方也顺从地停在了原地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚守卫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，按照公爵阁下的命令，现在每辆通行的车辆都要接受搜查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维多利亚守卫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把货卸下来——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“咚”，结实的一棍砸在他的头顶。而另一个守卫还来不及呼救，一个黑影出现在他背后，勒紧了他的脖子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人，按您的安排，我们重新扫清了道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把情况同步给诺希斯大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抓紧运送补给，千万不能耽误了时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_i07_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知是谁的鲜血模糊了视线，顺着脸颊流入嘴角。\n她尝到了久违的腥甜味。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"双锏颤动，挥挡着从四面八方袭来的锋刃，这些刁钻的攻击已经在她身上留下了无数伤口，就算如此，步履却丝毫没有后退。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_i07_3"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_i07_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"而在她的周围，已经躺了七八个倒下的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_i07_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"黑骑士，你已经到极限了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"其实对你来说，还有缴械投降这一个选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"净说大话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"够胆的，别耍嘴上的功夫，接着上啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算是你，也会有鲜血流干的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"死在这里，不遗憾吗？骑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"无聊的废话，讲给——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"死不足惜的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_i07_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_i07_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"铮——！\n她抓住一人松懈的破绽，将他击飞出去。\n她本不能挥出这强大一击，那力量确实出自许久未能触动的怒火。\n已是满身伤痕的骑士此刻的气势，震慑着敌人的内心。\n有人后退了半步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_i07_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......怕什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"骑士拖着摇晃的步伐向前，在地上留下两行血迹。\n她的眼睛异常明亮，却有血丝游动，她快要支撑不住身体，那份强大的执着不知从何而来。\n堂厅的蜡烛火光渐渐熄灭，地上的倒影愈发模糊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"终于，一个踉跄......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"数发烟雾弹射进院落，将一切掩护在烟雾当中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"不是蔓珠院的护卫，有情报之外的势力介入战局，任务评估为不可继续。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"行动中止，带伤员撤退。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"还算及时......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚的精锐打手不好对付，我们得先找个地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"醒醒，别睡过去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳，你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Sharp？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"少说点话，你现在伤重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士让你来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"博士和银灰先生一直有联络。听说谢拉格发生了天灾，博士猜到你们会遇到麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然现在实在腾不开手，但博士答应过，只要谢拉格有难，不会坐视不理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经通知罗德岛增援，他们随后赶到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恩希欧迪斯呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"不用担心，相信银灰先生已对局面有所掌控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"坚持住，锏，最艰难的时候你已经挺过去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_G9_kjeragarsenal"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......目前的产量还能维持吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂负责人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，弹药可以按照计划供应。可是，诺希斯总裁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂负责人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我无法不抱有疑问......如果我们要对抗的，是开斯特公爵的舰队，那即使我们生产效率提高十倍，也不可能与他们抗衡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用担心，按计划去做就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的事由我们处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂负责人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂负责人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诺希斯总裁，我为喀兰贸易工作了十一年，我知道它为谢拉格带来过什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工厂负责人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，你已经做好了准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":"avg_206_gnosis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用不着我再多提醒了，希瓦艾什的家主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然是要去谈判，总该换上正装才是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_i14_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"开斯特公爵的军队四面围困了谢拉格，一些先头部队已经控制了部分街道，把民众赶回了家中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯带人去对峙，但他的军队在维多利亚人面前显得过于单薄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"公爵的使者来到喀兰贸易，让我转交一份要求谈判的“请柬”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她在等你，恩希欧迪斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"听上去，情况没有发生预期外的变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你还在欣赏这艘孤零零的高速战舰......它在这个时候看起来是不是太过单薄了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最近我总会想起，很多年以前，我的父母接受布朗陶家的邀约的那一天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父亲当时说过，布朗陶和佩尔罗契不支持我们，是因为他们没有看到他所能看到的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“如果有人能踏出一步，哪怕只有一步......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"即便是恶名在外的卢卡·布朗陶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们知道有最糟糕的可能，但他们没有犹豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如今我已经活到了他们去世时的年纪，比起那时，似乎也什么都没有改变......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我至少知道了，为什么当年他们没有犹豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在那之后，我随着家族离开了谢拉格，去到维多利亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是一段艰难的开始，我几乎凭着惯性在学习，适应那些维多利亚同学的白眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唯一能支撑我的，就是我知道会有那么一天，我会回到谢拉格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是后来，你也来维多利亚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在校园里和你第一次打招呼时你的表情，我恐怕是忘不掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是没想到，你打招呼的方式，竟然是像个天真的傻子一样问我还记不记得小时候的约定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“你还愿不愿意，把谢拉格变成一个足够大，足够让我们施展拳脚的舞台。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但也因此我能确信，你所说的一切，你看到的未来，绝非一种幻想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我这才会跟着喀兰贸易，一路走到了今天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“今天”，是远远不够的，诺希斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我即将去面见那位严酷的庄家与债主......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......无论我是否还能看到，我都会让谢拉格能拥有“明天”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我最后只想让你知道，不只是我们，支持你的谢拉格人还有很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喀兰贸易这些年的努力没有白费。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果说有什么是我想在这里听到的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你总能让别人说出你想听到的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"比如？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"比如你会对锏说，自己只是把她当作棋子，合约到期她可以选择是否留在谢拉格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但你明知道她会如何回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或许我想听到那些话，正是因为我没有那么肯定你们会如何回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你害怕了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"二十多年前，说出要把谢拉格建成足够大的舞台时，我就放弃了可以恐惧的权力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是亲历者，应该不至于忘记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......只是有时候，我也会需要一些话语支撑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么在你看来，我和锏做到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......毫无疑问。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_i14_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我很庆幸......是你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或许，未来的谢拉格，不再需要做那些代价惊人的交易，也不再需要依托蔓珠院才能拥有信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或许，你们会是比我更好的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"少自作多情了，恩希欧迪斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_i14_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你理想里那个未来的谢拉格，你自己去看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是个不敢直面理想的胆小鬼，也随你。我和锏都有自己的事情要忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诺希斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就像现在，我该走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_i14_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"67_i14_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如你所愿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
